      fonts[i] = GfxFont::makeFont(xref, fontDict->getKey(i),
                                   r, obj2.getDict());
```

`GfxFont::makeFont` takes the Dict pointer and stores it in the font. The font constructor stores the dict pointer. When the font is deleted, does it free the dict?

